    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>hilbert-keys-bounds · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-hilbert-keys-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-hilbert-keys-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const boundsOutOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; boundsOut: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const ITEM_COUNT: u32 = 1275u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">const FLOAT32_MAXIMUM: f32 = 3.402823466e+38;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const PARTIAL_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const WORKGROUP_THREADS: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">// Returns (x, y, valid, 0) for an item: the point, or the box center (halved before the sum to\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">// avoid overflow near FLT_MAX).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn readItem(row: u32) -&gt; vec4f {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  let point = vec2f(positions[positionsOffset + row * 2u], positions[positionsOffset + row * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  let valid = isFiniteValue(point.x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(point.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  return vec4f(point, select(0.0, 1.0, valid), 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedMinima: array&lt;vec2f, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedMaxima: array&lt;vec2f, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"26\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"27\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  _ = &amp;boundsOut;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  // Exactly one workgroup is dispatched, so index == localInvocationIndex.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  var localMinimum = vec2f(FLOAT32_MAXIMUM);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  var localMaximum = vec2f(-FLOAT32_MAXIMUM);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  // Grid-stride loop: consecutive threads read consecutive items on every trip.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  for (var row = index; row &lt; ITEM_COUNT; row += PARTIAL_COUNT * WORKGROUP_THREADS) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    let item = readItem(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    if (item.z &gt; 0.5) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      localMinimum = min(localMinimum, item.xy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">      localMaximum = max(localMaximum, item.xy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  sharedMinima[localInvocationIndex] = localMinimum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  sharedMaxima[localInvocationIndex] = localMaximum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  for (var stride = 128u; stride &gt; 0u; stride = stride &gt;&gt; 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    if (localInvocationIndex &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">      sharedMinima[localInvocationIndex] = min(sharedMinima[localInvocationIndex], sharedMinima[localInvocationIndex + stride]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">      sharedMaxima[localInvocationIndex] = max(sharedMaxima[localInvocationIndex], sharedMaxima[localInvocationIndex + stride]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  if (localInvocationIndex == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">    let minimum = sharedMinima[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    let maximum = sharedMaxima[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    let hasValid = minimum.x &lt;= maximum.x &amp;&amp; minimum.y &lt;= maximum.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    boundsOut[boundsOutOffset] = select(0.0, minimum.x, hasValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    boundsOut[boundsOutOffset + 1u] = select(0.0, minimum.y, hasValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    boundsOut[boundsOutOffset + 2u] = select(0.0, maximum.x, hasValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">    boundsOut[boundsOutOffset + 3u] = select(0.0, maximum.y, hasValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"places\">places</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>boundsOut<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"hilbert-keys-bounds\">hilbert-keys-bounds</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUHilbertKeys/bounds-points · main · c636fa6b</figcaption></figure></section>",
